            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.5.0</h2>
<p>Cut the dead air in one click, and show your app on an iPhone.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Trim Silences</strong>: removes the pauses where nothing is said and nothing happens on screen.</li>
  <li><strong>iPhone frame</strong>: put your recording on an iPhone, in Natural or Black titanium.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
