            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.4.0</h2>
<p>Change what's behind you, style presets, music, and an important fix.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Behind You</strong>: blur your room, use a clean studio backdrop, or remove it and leave just you.</li>
  <li><strong>Style presets</strong>: save your look, apply it in one click, and use it for new recordings.</li>
  <li><strong>Music</strong>: a track under your video that fades and dips while you talk.</li>
  <li><strong>Private crash reports</strong> you choose to send.</li>
  <li><strong>Fix</strong>: a crash in vertical videos with Fill, or with the MacBook frame.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
