            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.3.1</h2>
<p>Vertical videos that fill the frame, and a fixed keystroke display.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fill Vertical Frame</strong>: your screen fills vertical videos and follows your pointer.</li>
  <li><strong>Zooms always fill the frame</strong>: no background or MacBook frame around a zoomed screen.</li>
  <li><strong>Captions for phones</strong>: bigger in vertical videos, above the strip phone apps cover.</li>
  <li><strong>Fixes</strong>: the keystroke display is upright, and new recordings show shortcuts only.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
